      "writtenOn": "2023-10-09T23:33:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this path is triggered when any profile\u0027s connection state changed, see [code search](https://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dhandleProfileConnectionStateChange\u0026sq\u003drepo:android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main). \nIt can be from remote device turned off, or from out of range, or from phone\u0027s Bluetooth off. \nBut as long as it is not disconnected by the user, and is connection policy allowed, the phone should consider it as candidate for auto connection :)",
